orage"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"margin":0},"children":"OAuth tokens are stored server-side only, in the database and never in browser storage or URLs. They are not logged or returned to the client. Drafts, scheduled posts and saved media are stored server-side and are scoped to your account: no other user can read, modify or preview them, and knowing an asset id is not enough to access it. Saved media (uploads, AI-generated images, Canva imports, branded variants) is retained for 30 days and then removed."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":14,"fontWeight":800,"color":"#0F172A","margin":"0 0 6px"},"children":"4. Sharing"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"margin":0},"children":"We do not sell your data. Data is sent only to the platform APIs you authorize (LinkedIn, Facebook/Instagram Graph, Canva, and AI providers listed in our model docs) for the single purpose of completing your request."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":14,"fontWeight":800,"color":"#0F172A","margin":"0 0 6px"},"children":"5. Disconnect & deletion"}],["$","ul",null,{"style":{"margin":0,"paddingLeft":18,"display":"flex","flexDirection":"column","gap":4},"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Disconnect any platform at any time via the app (Account card → Disconnect) — this deletes the server token immediately."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"You can also revoke access directly in LinkedIn > Settings > Permitted services or Meta Business Suite > Integrations."}],["$","li",null,{"children":["Contact us to delete all stored data: ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:privacy@dotstark.tech","style":{"color":"#7C3AED","fontWeight":700,"textDecoration":"none"},"children":"privacy@dotstark.tech"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":14,"fontWeight":800,"color":"#0F172A","margin":"0 0 6px"},"children":"6. Retention"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"margin":0},"children":"Tokens are kept until you discon